## 1. Purpose and License Classification

This License permits the Autobricks PKI Server 1.0 software to be publicly available in source-code form for inspection, security review, audit, evaluation, testing, building, authorized use, and redistribution of unmodified copies.

The Software may be downloaded, compiled, built, installed, and used in its original and unmodified form.

This License does **not** grant a general right to modify the Software or create derivative works.

Accordingly, this License is a **source-available license** and is not intended to qualify as an Open Source license under the Open Source Initiative definition.

All rights not expressly granted by this License are reserved by the Licensor.

