## 2. Definitions

For purposes of this License:

### 2.1 Software

**"Software"** means Autobricks PKI Server 1.0 and all materials distributed under this License, including, where applicable:

* source code;
* executable code;
* object code;
* scripts;
* service files;
* build files;
* configuration templates;
* database schemas;
